@startuml
title Feature 002 - Atomic Join, Concurrent Submit and End
actor "Student A" as A
actor "Student B" as B
actor Teacher as T
participant "Role / Account Guards" as G
participant "Ordered Command Service" as C
database SQLite as DB
A -> G : join(groupId, name, requestId)
G -> C : stable participant, validate name
C -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE\ncheck available group + no prior group
C -> DB : bind participant + lock name + revision + receipt
DB --> C : COMMIT
C --> A : success, full group name
B -> G : competing join same group
G -> C : validate
C -> DB : check occupied
DB --> C : group occupied
C --> B : reject; no partial bind or rename
B -> G : join another free group with required name
G -> C : validate participant and name
C -> DB : atomically bind free group + name + receipt
DB --> C : COMMIT
C --> B : success, other full group name
note over A,DB
Waiting student projection contains no question data.
Only after owner start commit do student questions appear.
end note
par close-in-time submissions
  A -> G : complete answers(request A)
  G -> C : validated actor + payload
else
  B -> G : complete answers(request B)
  G -> C : validated actor + payload
end
C -> DB : first queued command: BEGIN IMMEDIATE\nvalidate active + full item set + not answered
alt invalid or incomplete
  C -> DB : no submission / no sequence allocation
  C --> A : explicit rejection
else valid
  C -> DB : all answers + nextSequence + revision + receipt
  DB --> C : COMMIT
  C --> A : own receipt only
  C --> T : owner-only progress after commit
end
C -> DB : process next queued command using next sequence
DB --> C : COMMIT or explicit rejection
A -> C : ack timeout / reconnect / resend same request
C -> DB : lookup durable actor/event/requestId receipt
DB --> C : same fingerprint: prior outcome
C --> A : same receipt; no new sequence
T -> G : end(requestId)
G -> C : verified owner
C -> DB : end + frozen results + unique job + receipt
DB --> C : COMMIT
C --> T : ended; automatic writeback queued
B -> C : later answer
C -> DB : phase already ended
C --> B : INVALID_PHASE; order unchanged
note over C,DB
DB failure: rollback, no success ack.
No visible mutation before commit.
Crash after commit before ack: restart then read same receipt.
Same requestId with different payload: REQUEST_CONFLICT.
end note
@enduml
